  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Storage and Grid Services, through Hatch Associates Consultants, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA grant to eleQtra (East Africa) Limited funds a feasibility study (Study) for a proposed energy storage, grid services, and potential solar PV project in Uganda. The study would provide technical, legal, and economic analysis necessary to determine the configuration of either a permanent energy storage system paired with solar photovoltaic (PV) or a transportable energy storage system. Successful implementation to the Project would make the Ugandan grid more efficient, stable, and cost-effective by providing ancillary services to manage solar and hydropower and limit transmission losses. Hatch Associates Consultants, Inc. is carrying out the Study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
  </description>
